# Files that live in docs/ but are not pages of the documentation site.
# .gitignore syntax. Excluded files are not published and are not reachable by URL.

# The generated CLI reference. It is the authority for every flag (rendered from the real
# clap tree by `cargo xtask gen-cli-ref`) and is linked from the README, but the site
# publishes it through reference/cli.mdx, which adds a title and an intro.
# Publishing both would put a duplicate in the sitemap and in llms.txt.
cli.md

# Contributor docs for this folder, not a page.
README.md

# Tooling.
scripts/
